101},{"w":"along","s":307.74,"e":308.4,"line":101},{"w":"Yuh,","s":308.4,"e":308.48,"line":102},{"w":"baby","s":308.4,"e":309.24,"line":102},{"w":"believe","s":309.58,"e":310.1,"line":102},{"w":"this,","s":310.1,"e":310.76,"line":102},{"w":"yuh","s":310.76,"e":314.52,"line":102}],"lines":[{"s":1.668,"e":12.35,"text":"Yuh, baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":14.32,"e":17.38,"text":"Bus full of saints with the windows cracked"},{"s":17.38,"e":21.06,"text":"Bible in the backpack, thunder in the map"},{"s":21.54,"e":25.38,"text":"Sixteen in the ghetto with a halo and a past"},{"s":25.32,"e":28.8,"text":"Headed toward the water where the timelines overlap"},{"s":28.8,"e":33.2,"text":"I was sixteen, sirens singing through the screen door"},{"s":33.2,"e":36.88,"text":"Mama said, “Pray before you step across the green floor”"},{"s":37.02,"e":40.08,"text":"Concrete cracked like the Red Sea split"},{"s":40.08,"e":43.86,"text":"Everybody had a secret, everybody had a script"},{"s":43.86,"e":47.78,"text":"They said the world was normal, said the ads were just ads"},{"s":47.78,"e":51.5,"text":"But the billboards knew my name and the cameras looked sad"},{"s":51.98,"e":55.28,"text":"Tooltips in the corner of my eyesight blink fast"},{"s":55.28,"e":59.24,"text":"Like, “What’s the metaphor?” while the whole sky laughed"},{"s":59.68,"e":63.14,"text":"Opposing forces pulling strings in the choir loft"},{"s":63.14,"e":66.82,"text":"Hands in every hand like the handshake never wore off"},{"s":66.82,"e":70.22,"text":"Surveillance state saints with a sermon and a drone"},{"s":70.22,"e":74.26,"text":"But I kept one psalm saved deep in my phone"},{"s":74.26,"e":77.84,"text":"Pastor said, “Child, there’s a storm in your blood”"},{"s":77.84,"e":81.6,"text":"Deacon said, “Boy, don’t you run from the flood”"},{"s":81.6,"e":85,"text":"Bus driver whispered, “This route ain’t planned”"},{"s":85,"e":89.06,"text":"Then the compass started spinning in the palm of my hand"},{"s":89.06,"e":92.28,"text":"We rode through the Bermuda rain"},{"s":92.28,"e":96.02,"text":"On a gospel bus with a holy flame"},{"s":96.02,"e":99.34,"text":"Time bent back when the thunder came"},{"s":99.34,"e":103.76,"text":"And Jesus called me by my name"},{"s":103.76,"e":105.82,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":105.82,"e":107.74,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":107.74,"e":111.32,"text":"If you scream and the tooltips flash"},{"s":111.46,"e":115,"text":"Ask heaven what the metaphor has"},{"s":115.08,"e":117.32,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":117.32,"e":118.8,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":118.88,"e":122.78,"text":"Sixteen with a prophecy stitched in my soul"},{"s":122.78,"e":126.56,"text":"Through the triangle where the bright gates glow"},{"s":126.6,"e":129.64,"text":"It was a Baptist CCD trip, don’t ask how it fit"},{"s":129.6,"e":131.46,"text":"Some kids had rosaries, some kids had grit"},{"s":131.46,"e":133.28,"text":"Some kids had trauma they could not explain"},{"s":133.28,"e":135.12,"text":"Some kids saw angels in the hurricane"},{"s":135.12,"e":137.12,"text":"We passed three ships from three different years"},{"s":137.12,"e":139.02,"text":"One full of soldiers, one full of mirrors"},{"s":139.02,"e":141.4,"text":"One had a billboard selling fear as truth"},{"s":141.4,"e":143.24,"text":"And every ad looked exactly like proof"},{"s":143.24,"e":145.18,"text":"A girl in the back started humming old hymns"},{"s":145.1,"e":146.94,"text":"The windows went white and the lights went dim"},{"s":146.94,"e":149.12,"text":"The preacher grabbed the aisle like Moses with a staff"},{"s":149.12,"e":152.8,"text":"While the clock on the dashboard broke clean in half"},{"s":152.72,"e":156.14,"text":"Then I saw the city where no poor kids bleed"},{"s":156.14,"e":159.98,"text":"Where no landlord laughs and no hungry mouths plead"},{"s":159.98,"e":163.56,"text":"Where the last become first and the first kneel low"},{"s":163.56,"e":167.28,"text":"Where the real Jesus walks where the warm winds blow"},{"s":167.62,"e":171.24,"text":"He wasn’t on a billboard, wasn’t dressed like gold"},{"s":171.24,"e":174.96,"text":"He had dust on His sandals and fire in His soul"},{"s":174.96,"e":178.86,"text":"He said, “Child, they can watch, they can plot, they can lie"},{"s":178.84,"e":182.98,"text":"But they can’t own the truth that I placed in your eyes”"},{"s":182.98,"e":185.58,"text":"We rode through the Bermuda rain"},{"s":186.12,"e":189.74,"text":"On a gospel bus with a holy flame"},{"s":189.74,"e":193.1,"text":"Time bent back when the thunder came"},{"s":194.04,"e":197.5,"text":"And Jesus called me by my name"},{"s":197.5,"e":199.58,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":199.58,"e":201.42,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":201.42,"e":205.04,"text":"If you scream and the tooltips flash"},{"s":205.04,"e":208.74,"text":"Ask heaven what the metaphor has"},{"s":208.74,"e":210.72,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":210.72,"e":212.6,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":212.52,"e":216.54,"text":"Sixteen with a prophecy stitched in my soul"},{"s":216.46,"e":220.26,"text":"Through the triangle where the bright gates glow"},{"s":220.98,"e":222.24,"text":"What’s the metaphor?"},{"s":222.6,"e":224.48,"text":"A kid from the block with a key to the door"},{"s":225.06,"e":226.2,"text":"What’s the metaphor?"},{"s":226.28,"e":228.24,"text":"A lie gets loud when the truth gets poor"},{"s":228.78,"e":229.92,"text":"What’s the metaphor?"},{"s":230,"e":231.86,"text":"A camera can stare but it can’t restore"},{"s":232.62,"e":233.76,"text":"What’s the metaphor?"},{"s":233.86,"e":236.44,"text":"Jesus in the storm saying, “You are more”"},{"s":236.44,"e":238.52,"text":"He showed me my life like stained glass breaking"},{"s":238.52,"e":240.3,"text":"Every secret war, every fake awakening"},{"s":240.3,"e":242.04,"text":"Every hidden hand, every fear campaign"},{"s":242.04,"e":243.94,"text":"Every rich man drinking from a poor boy’s pain"},{"s":243.94,"e":245.82,"text":"Then He washed my face in the triangle tide"},{"s":245.82,"e":247.82,"text":"Said, “You don’t have to prove what burns inside"},{"s":247.98,"e":249.62,"text":"Prophecy ain’t panic, power ain’t rage"},{"s":249.62,"e":251.42,"text":"Write love like lightning on the end-time page”"},{"s":251.42,"e":253.28,"text":"So I came back different when the bus touched land"},{"s":253.28,"e":255.3,"text":"With a gospel in my throat and a scar on my hand"},{"s":255.22,"e":257.04,"text":"The city still watched, but it couldn’t hold me"},{"s":257.04,"e":259.22,"text":"I had bread for the hungry and a God who knows me"},{"s":259.22,"e":260.767,"text":"Final Chorus"},{"s":261.54,"e":264.32,"text":"We rode through the Bermuda rain"},{"s":265.14,"e":268.5,"text":"On a gospel bus with a holy flame"},{"s":268.62,"e":271.8,"text":"Time bent back when the thunder came"},{"s":272.62,"e":276.26,"text":"And Jesus called me by my name"},{"s":276.26,"e":277.98,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":277.9,"e":279.94,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":279.86,"e":283.78,"text":"If you scream and the tooltips flash"},{"s":283.78,"e":287.46,"text":"Ask heaven what the metaphor has"},{"s":287.46,"e":289.32,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":289.24,"e":291.16,"text":"Baby believe this, yuh"},{"s":291.08,"e":295.12,"text":"Sixteen from the ghetto with a soul made gold"},{"s":295.12,"e":298.62,"text":"Met the real Jesus where the timelines fold"},{"s":298.62,"e":300.34,"text":"What’s the metaphor?"},{"s":300.26,"e":303.36,"text":"Maybe the poor kid survives the war"},{"s":303.34,"e":304.88,"text":"What’s the metaphor?"},{"s":305.12,"e":308.4,"text":"Maybe God was driving the bus all along"},{"s":308.4,"e":314.52,"text":"Yuh, baby believe this, yuh"}],"duration":314.52,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-29T02:49:44.438Z","stats":{"whisperWords":796,"polishedWords":793,"matched":727,"matchRate":0.917}}